  "_what": "The PRE-SCHEME baseline for the route-escalation mechanism's trigger 4 (\"no better than doing nothing\"). Pinned BEFORE the scheme shipped, because after it ships every number here is contaminated by it.",
  "_why_pinned_and_not_computed_at_read_time": "A comparator recomputed on every run cannot detect that the thing it compares against has moved. Pinned so drift is visible; scripts/check-decision-scheme.py --rederive recomputes and reports the delta.",
